Release IPQ50xx NSS module resources before reload.

Unregister the stats sysctl and panic notifier, stop and cancel coredump
work, and drain frequency work before removing core mappings. Track common
and platform ownership for symbol-only loads and late init failure unwind.
Connection-table pages are freed after the hardware producers stop.

